✏️ Your Leave Request Was Updated
=====
<h2>Hello {{#with requester}}{{this.full_name}}{{/with}},</h2>

<div class="info-box info-box-success">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #059669;">✅ Request Updated</h3>
  <p>Your pending leave request was updated and is still awaiting approval from <strong>{{#with approver }}{{this.full_name}}{{/with}}</strong>.</p>
  {{#if edited_by}}
  {{#unless (eq edited_by.id requester.id)}}
  <p><em>Updated by admin {{edited_by.full_name}}.</em></p>
  {{/unless}}
  {{/if}}
</div>

<div class="content-card">
  <div class="content-card-header">
    <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #1f2937;">📅 Updated Leave Request</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="content-card-body">
    <p><strong>{{> email/leave_request_detail leave=leave }}</strong></p>
    {{> email/leave_comments comments=comments }}
    <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">
      Originally requested on {{as_date_from_timestamp leave.created_at}}.
      {{#if leave.edited_at}}Last edited on {{as_date_from_timestamp leave.edited_at}}.{{/if}}
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">⏳ What Happens Next?</h3>
  <p>Your supervisor will review the updated request and you'll receive another email once a decision is made.</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 20px;">Best regards,<br><strong>The TimeOff.Management Team</strong></p>
